---
layout: base.njk
pageKey: voice
title: AI Voice Agent
permalink: voice-agent.html
description: A customer-service voice agent designed around your business to answer routine calls, take structured orders, handle common scheduling requests, qualify leads, and hand complex calls to your team.
capabilities:
  - title: Answer and greet
    text: Opens with your brand, understands why the person called, and keeps the conversation focused.
  - title: Take orders
    text: Captures items, options, pickup or delivery details, and the information your team needs.
  - title: Book and reschedule
    text: Handles common appointment requests and confirms the next step with the caller.
  - title: Qualify leads
    text: Collects service, location, timing, budget, and contact details before your team follows up.
  - title: Escalate to a human
    text: Routes urgent, sensitive, or complex calls with the context already gathered.
  - title: Summarize and follow up
    text: Turns each handled call into a clean summary, structured details, and a clear next action.
useCases:
  - label: Restaurants
    title: Orders without tying up the counter
    text: Handle menu questions, pickup orders, common requests, and large-order enquiries while staff serves customers.
    example: Pizza shops / takeout / catering
  - label: Home services
    title: Better estimate requests
    text: Ask the right intake questions, capture job details, and separate urgent calls from routine quotes.
    example: Construction / roofing / HVAC
  - label: Appointments
    title: Fewer scheduling interruptions
    text: Help callers request, move, or confirm appointments without pulling a specialist away from the work.
    example: Salons / auto services / consultants
  - label: General service
    title: A dependable first line
    text: Answer approved repeat questions, collect messages, route departments, and leave your team with a useful summary.
    example: Local teams / offices / franchises
---

{# ===== Product hero ================================================== #}
<section class="section section--tight voice-hero has-aurora">
  <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="voice-hero__grid">
      <div class="voice-hero__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">AI voice agent</span>
        <h1 class="voice-hero__title">Your business, answered - even when your team is busy.</h1>
        <p class="voice-hero__lead">
          A customer-service phone agent designed around your menu, schedule, services, approved
          answers, and rules. It handles routine calls, takes structured action, and brings in a
          person when the conversation needs one.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row mt-6">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="#call-preview">Preview a call flow</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">Plan my call flow</a>
        </div>
        <p class="voice-hero__note">Built around your workflow. Human handoff when it matters.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="voice-routing" aria-label="Example voice-agent routing flow">
        <div class="voice-routing__top">
          <span><i class="voice-routing__live" aria-hidden="true"></i>Incoming customer call</span>
          <span class="voice-routing__time">00:42</span>
        </div>
        <div class="voice-routing__signal" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <ol class="voice-routing__steps">
          <li class="is-complete"><span>01</span>Greet with your brand</li>
          <li class="is-complete"><span>02</span>Understand the request</li>
          <li class="is-active"><span>03</span>Take the right action</li>
          <li><span>04</span>Summarize or hand off</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="voice-routing__result">
          <span>Next action</span>
          <strong>Order details ready for confirmation</strong>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Capabilities ================================================== #}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">What it can handle</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">Routine calls become structured next steps</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        We shape the agent around what callers actually ask and what your team needs to happen next.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="voice-capabilities">
      {% for capability in capabilities %}
        <article class="voice-capability" data-reveal>
          <span class="voice-capability__num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <h3>{{ capability.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ capability.text }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Honest scripted preview ====================================== #}
<section class="section section--tint" id="call-preview">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Call-flow preview</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">See how it would handle the call</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        Pick a business scenario, then walk through the conversation one decision at a time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="voice-preview" data-voice-preview data-reveal>
      <div class="voice-preview__controls">
        <div>
          <span class="voice-preview__label">Choose a call type</span>
          <div class="voice-preview__scenarios" role="group" aria-label="Choose a call scenario">
            <button
              class="voice-scenario is-active"
              type="button"
              data-voice-scenario="restaurant"
              aria-pressed="true"
            >
              Restaurant order
            </button>
            <button
              class="voice-scenario"
              type="button"
              data-voice-scenario="construction"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              Estimate request
            </button>
            <button
              class="voice-scenario"
              type="button"
              data-voice-scenario="appointment"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              Appointment change
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="voice-preview__disclosure">Illustrative - scripted demo</span>
      </div>

      <div class="voice-preview__stage">
        <div class="voice-preview__call">
          <div class="voice-preview__callbar">
            <span>
              <i class="voice-routing__live" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <strong data-voice-title>Restaurant order</strong>
            </span>
            <span data-voice-status>Incoming call</span>
          </div>

          <ol
            class="voice-timeline"
            data-voice-timeline
            aria-live="polite"
            aria-label="Scripted call timeline"
          >
            <li class="voice-timeline__step is-active">
              <span class="voice-timeline__marker">01</span>
              <div>
                <span class="voice-timeline__speaker">Caller</span>
                <p>&ldquo;Can I place a pickup order for tonight?&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>

          <div class="voice-preview__actions">
            <button class="btn btn--primary" type="button" data-voice-next>Next call step</button>
            <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-voice-restart>Restart</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="voice-summary" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="voice-summary__label">Call outcome</span>
          <strong data-voice-outcome>Waiting for the call flow</strong>
          <p data-voice-outcome-detail>Advance the preview to see what the business receives.</p>
          <ul class="voice-summary__facts" data-voice-facts>
            <li>Intent identified</li>
            <li>Details structured</li>
            <li>Next action assigned</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Industry playbooks =========================================== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">One system, different playbooks</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">Designed around the calls your business receives</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        The conversation, actions, and escalation rules change with the business. The goal stays
        the same: help the caller and leave the team with clarity.
      </p>
